  "body": "Goldens and the shared test helpers sit under `crates/app/tests`, so every suite that reads them has to live in `app`. Give the goldens one documented home the quick tier understands, and split `crates/app/tests/common` so the helpers that need only `cl` can be used from other crates. Then `golden_cl` and the 5 generator-fed sim tests run in `crates/motion/tests`, and `stock_field_cost` and `warned_moves` (with its module) in sim.\n\nDone means: goldens have one documented home and quick knows which suites read them; the listed suites run outside app with the same test count; sim is in the release heavy lane; no golden content changes.\n\nLists, counts and evidence: the research comment on #919 (https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/919#issuecomment-6808141599).\n\nPart of #919.\n",
